Subject: Fitting a basic 2-state HMM
Message-ID: <ktLwEiVOwbQ.DH4LEcO3DAAJ@nimble-users.groups.google.com>
Archived-At: <https://groups.google.com/g/nimble-users/c/ktLwEiVOwbQ/m/DH4LEcO3DAAJ>
