From udd632bd3bbcdd7e9 at groups.google.com  Mon Dec 19 14:40:00 2016
From: udd632bd3bbcdd7e9 at groups.google.com (Perry de Valpine)
Date: Mon, 19 Dec 2016 14:40:00 +0000
Subject: Re: Custom Sampler and mvSaved
Message-ID: <tUvj-_94Zig.PmX0Zh2fCgAJ@nimble-users.groups.google.com>
